{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>現年38歲歌手譚嘉儀（Kayee）早前趁38歲生日宣布圈外男友求婚成功的消息，上月她亦在社交平台曬出過大禮的照片，場面華麗極具氣派。昨日（6日）她在社交平台分享婚紗照，她在中秋節完成傳統的過大禮儀式後，與未婚夫一同飛往意大利水鄉威尼斯，拍攝充滿浪漫和奢華氣息的婚紗照。</p><figure><img alt=\"譚嘉儀曬威尼斯浪漫婚照。(ig@kayeepo)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261006/1184268533190627328950413.jpeg/Je8hsSy_CRKyy2C3Wi5XFmx9wW2rvOQK1B9E-9QfRPs\"/><figcaption>譚嘉儀曬威尼斯浪漫婚照。(ig@kayeepo)</figcaption></figure><p>譚嘉儀曬威尼斯浪漫婚照</p><p>當中有一張照片二人盛裝乘坐著威尼斯著名的貢多拉（又譯：鳳尾船 / 意大利文：Gondola）暢遊運河，未婚夫深情地親吻嘉儀的臉頰，幸福之情無法掩飾。威尼斯的美麗景色映襯著譚嘉儀的婚紗造型，成為大家的焦點。譚嘉儀的婚紗選擇了低胸剪裁，以絲綢面料展現她豐滿的身材，再加上夢幻的羽毛及花瓣裙擺，整體造型既性感又高貴，流露出如公主般的迷人氣質。</p><figure><img alt=\"譚嘉儀與未婚夫乘坐著威尼斯著名的貢多拉暢遊運河。(ig@kayeepo)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261006/1184268681446690816036825.jpeg/tQfV_TcYmy6rVM1TU-Jy4EZk0S21o-Ic1_45Udf-OVE\"/><figcaption>譚嘉儀與未婚夫乘坐著威尼斯著名的貢多拉暢遊運河。(ig@kayeepo)</figcaption></figure><p>譚嘉儀深情告白未婚夫</p><p>她在帖文中寫道：「Take my hand, take my whole life, too. For I can’t help falling in love with you.（牽起我的手吧，也把我的整個人生帶走，因我情不自禁愛上了你。）」這句話充分表達了她對未婚夫的深厚愛意，並透露對未來新生活的期待。這組婚紗照一經發布，立即引來圈中好友和粉絲紛紛留言祝賀，大家都為他們的新篇章送上最美好的祝福。</p><figure><img alt=\"譚嘉儀深情告白未婚夫。(ig@kayeepo)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261006/1184269336610082816578032.jpeg/Khc-F5sfcTLSKPGBzQTm4MLwpkgb4aHYQHTFYkB0xWI\"/><figcaption>譚嘉儀深情告白未婚夫。(ig@kayeepo)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"譚嘉儀對未婚夫的深厚愛意。(ig@kayeepo)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261006/1184269334563131392326057.jpeg/GFn2RVZKG2tiZFyYiC9fHkJzbmhP9f-ZhZgTtIWYE7Q\"/><figcaption>譚嘉儀對未婚夫的深厚愛意。(ig@kayeepo)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"譚嘉儀透露對未來新生活的期待。(ig@kayeepo)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261006/1184269332159664128925807.jpeg/2uvj4IFx3lMlinQ0vvOnMHnnlXc9goC2LdclXy3XJV8\"/><figcaption>譚嘉儀透露對未來新生活的期待。(ig@kayeepo)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"譚嘉儀與未婚夫手拖手。(ig@kayeepo)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261006/1184269329869443072185327.jpeg/WXNlj0jJo-wDUYtg7m36idBBEP0vOAGhi9bgNIvW4DQ\"/><figcaption>譚嘉儀與未婚夫手拖手。(ig@kayeepo)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"譚嘉儀穿性感高貴婚紗。(ig@kayeepo)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261006/1184269327541473280903625.jpeg/mAgnDyluQqHxSeP8-BsElcOKzgMAIYLYR5gueEeYLng\"/><figcaption>譚嘉儀穿性感高貴婚紗。(ig@kayeepo)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"譚嘉儀婚紗極高貴。(ig@kayeepo)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261006/1184269336714940416634071.jpeg/h1YiKFZIjFBxDGTZmkdHxBAA1vfAo9z9jk1yw45NcsM\"/><figcaption>譚嘉儀婚紗極高貴。(ig@kayeepo)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"譚嘉儀透露對未來新生活的期待。(ig@kayeepo)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261006/1184269334407942144058627.jpeg/ewdQKYdvk0akYyWauT9DMkgdkiXvVkKLUoK5_lKCuf4\"/><figcaption>譚嘉儀透露對未來新生活的期待。(ig@kayeepo)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"譚嘉儀對未婚夫的深厚愛意。(ig@kayeepo)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261006/1184269332117721088870495.jpeg/0KTGHl9eepzU-bKerX-774ISrOGasJpP1lv5RNZb-UQ\"/><figcaption>譚嘉儀對未婚夫的深厚愛意。(ig@kayeepo)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"譚嘉儀婚紗極高貴。(ig@kayeepo)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261006/1184269329907191808189640.jpeg/7x7jsb29K4tia_Hfxxzc_AVp0eFCg0FgEMR5ihDEeYo\"/><figcaption>譚嘉儀婚紗極高貴。(ig@kayeepo)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"譚嘉儀對未婚夫的深厚愛意。(ig@kayeepo)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261006/1184269327595999232935678.jpeg/ZXKoNDnQd6l_HhufnpSiq0MHVcUSY9pofj-rzH4_q8w\"/><figcaption>譚嘉儀對未婚夫的深厚愛意。(ig@kayeepo)</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-07T00:39:55.819165+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":840,"images":12,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none"}}